# Line endings are LF in the repository and LF in the working tree, on every
# host.  The Windows CI job runs the shell scripts under MSYS2, and a checkout
# that translated them to CRLF would hand `sh' a `\r' at the end of every line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The 1985 MWC Z8001 executables in vendor/ are not text and must never be
# examined for line endings.
vendor/mwc-1985/* binary
vendor/mwc-1985/SOURCES.md text eol=lf
